<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia closes, opens coffee registrations.</title>
<headline>Colombia closes, opens coffee registrations.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's National Federation of Coffee Growers announced registrations for November coffee shipments by private exporters would close Nov 29.</p>
<p>In a brief statement the organization said registration for January and February shipments by private and federation exporters would open Dec 2.</p>
<p>Private exporters will be authorized toship 1,620,000 60-kilo bags in January through March, and federation exporters will be allowed to ship 1,08p,000 60-kilo bags, according to the statement.</p>
<p>--Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom 571 610 7944</p>
